      "value": "A more elegant solution would be a formal event system.\n\nSee a list of events and info about them, their titles etc. Not a list of rooms. Or events mixed into rooms. \n\nBut the events could list what room they will send you to when you join the event. This would also allow for a listing of upcoming events to be right next to the current active events.\n\nSeems more logical and less of a workaround/hack to me.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
