  "details": "This is as simple as flexible. You can take any random world, say a world with a big screen like Tiki Island or the Mushroom world..and turn into a dance party or video night.\n\"Cheesy 90s Dance and Techno Party\" <--- could be a title. Or \"Weird Japanese Show Night\" - you get the idea.\nThe new clone of the world should then have this title so people know what's going on in that world at this date/event. SIMPLE...but opens many possibilities.\n\nAll what it takes for many types of events (like you can see at LamespaceVR) is a world and video. And bingo, you can have \"Rocket Launch Parties\" or whatever. And users can make instances to their liking and make whatever event from whatever video, stream or show they want.\n\nThere could also be a \"system\" that only the host of the instance can select the videos or something and no-one else, except those the host allows.",
